{"ts":"2026-11-13T03:52:33.930Z","type":"output","turn":0,"text":"ZORK I: The Great Underground Empire\nInfocom interactive fiction - a fantasy story\nCopyright (c) 1981, 1982, 1983, 1984, 1985, 1986 Infocom, Inc. All rights reserved.\nZORK is a registered trademark of Infocom, Inc.\nRelease 119 / Serial number 880429\n\nWest of House\nYou are standing in an open field west of a white house, with a boarded front door.\nThere is a small mailbox here.","status_line":"West of House                                               Score: 0  Moves: 0","score":0}
{"ts":"2026-11-13T03:52:34.814Z","type":"command","turn":1,"text":"open mailbox"}
{"ts":"2026-11-13T03:52:34.823Z","type":"output","turn":1,"text":"Opening the small mailbox reveals a leaflet.","status_line":"West of House                                               Score: 0  Moves: 1","score":0}
{"ts":"2026-11-13T03:52:36.586Z","type":"command","turn":2,"text":"read leaflet"}
{"ts":"2026-11-13T03:52:36.589Z","type":"output","turn":2,"text":"(Taken)\n\"WELCOME TO ZORK!\n\nZORK is a game of adventure, danger, and low cunning. In it you will explore some of the most amazing territory ever seen by mortals. No computer should be without one!\"","status_line":"West of House                                               Score: 0  Moves: 2","score":0}
