{"ts":"2026-11-13T03:52:37.453Z","type":"output","turn":3,"text":"North of House\nYou are facing the north side of a white house. There is no door here, and all the windows are boarded up. To the north a narrow path winds through the trees.","status_line":"North of House                                              Score: 0  Moves: 3","score":0}
