{"ts":"2026-11-13T03:52:38.123Z","type":"output","turn":4,"text":"Behind House\nYou are behind the white house. A path leads into the forest to the east. In one corner of the house there is a small window which is slightly ajar.","status_line":"Behind House                                                Score: 0  Moves: 4","score":0}
{"ts":"2026-11-13T03:52:38.822Z","type":"command","turn":5,"text":"open window"}
{"ts":"2026-11-13T03:52:38.824Z","type":"output","turn":5,"text":"With great effort, you open the window far enough to allow entry.","status_line":"Behind House                                                Score: 0  Moves: 5","score":0}
{"ts":"2026-11-13T03:52:39.330Z","type":"command","turn":6,"text":"in"}
{"ts":"2026-11-13T03:52:39.333Z","type":"output","turn":6,"text":"Kitchen\nYou are in the kitchen of the white house. A table seems to have been used recently for the preparation of food. A passage leads to the west and a dark staircase can be seen leading upward. A dark chimney leads down and to the east is a small window which is open.\nA bottle is sitting on the table.\nThe glass bottle contains:\n  A quantity of water\nOn the table is an elongated brown sack, smelling of hot peppers.","status_line":"Kitchen                                                    Score: 10  Moves: 6","score":10}
