{"ts":"2026-11-13T03:52:51.745Z","type":"output","turn":24,"text":"The Troll Room\nThere is a brown sack here.\nA troll is here.\nYour sword has begun to glow very brightly.\nThe troll, disarmed, cowers in terror, pleading for his life in the guttural tongue of the trolls.","status_line":"The Troll Room                                            Score: 35  Moves: 24","score":35}
