{"ts":"2026-11-13T03:52:52.421Z","type":"output","turn":25,"text":"The unarmed troll cannot defend himself: He dies.\nAlmost as soon as the troll breathes his last breath, a cloud of sinister black fog envelops him, and when the fog lifts, the carcass has disappeared.\nYour sword is no longer glowing.","status_line":"The Troll Room                                            Score: 35  Moves: 25","score":35}
